name: sim.getVisionSensorRes
description: Returns the resolution of the vision sensor
luaSynopsis: list resolution = sim.getVisionSensorRes(int sensorHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int[2] resolution = sim.getVisionSensorRes(int sensorHandle)
inputs:
1. sensorHandle: handle of the vision sensor
outputs:
1. resolution: array containing the x and y resolution
